#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:2 c67b4492452a4668b107d37de2fba6a1
msgid "_`Bringing a sensorless machine up`"
msgstr ""
"_`无感电机起转`"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:4 044b655c566d420aa29438c069b0aa2b
msgid ""
"The task: the axis has no position sensor and no idea where the rotor is."
" Get it spinning anyway, to a speed at which the observer can take over, "
"and hand over cleanly."
msgstr ""
"任务：该轴没有位置传感器，也不知道转子在哪里。仍然要让它转起来，转到一个"
"观测器能接手的转速，并干净地交接。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:9 27a7a4248d5c4d13a9cb82ba99476d2a
msgid "What you need"
msgstr ""
"所需部件"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:11 4d15ac1e52af46d2b20bc9d922d41ee0
msgid ""
"``foc/core/startup.hpp`` -- the sequence: hold the rotor at a known "
"angle, drag the forced vector up with a known acceleration, stop at a "
"hand-over speed."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/startup.hpp`` ——整条时序：把转子保持在已知角度，以已知加速度"
"把强制矢量拖上去，在交接转速处停止。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:13 9586c6bc308f441ea701cf5b887e9590
msgid ""
"``foc/core/alignment.hpp`` -- the same idea without the pull: hold and "
"stop. Right when the angle is measured after the fact rather than "
"inferred."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/alignment.hpp`` ——同一想法去掉拖动：只保持，然后停止。适用于"
"角度是事后测得、而不是推断出来的场合。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:15 ed0e628fd93349eb8082715ae1ebfd5e
msgid ""
"``foc/core/observer/blended_observer.hpp`` -- what takes over at the end,"
" and why the hand-over happens at a *speed* rather than at a time."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/observer/blended_observer.hpp`` ——末端接手的东西，以及为什么"
"交接发生在 *转速* 上而不是在某个时刻。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:17 c7d450cc0ff9484f9586022d94a6d787
msgid ""
"``foc/core/stall_start.hpp`` -- what to do when the rotor never came with"
" the vector: a torque recipe for breaking the axis loose before trying "
"again."
msgstr ""
"``foc/core/stall_start.hpp`` ——转子始终没跟上矢量时怎么办：在重试之前先"
"把轴甩脱静止的一套转矩配方。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:21 19bb1480f67e4a2ab64eeb414b01b7c7
msgid "A minimal program"
msgstr ""
"最小程序"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:23 192ddd0283fa4329b809b686fde03551
msgid ""
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/startup-sensorless.cxx`` steps the sequence at the"
" control rate and prints every state change. The same file produces this "
"slice's figure."
msgstr ""
"``docs/doxygen/dox/demos/startup-sensorless.cxx`` 按控制频率推进这条时序，"
"并打印每一次状态变化。本切片的图也由同一个文件产生。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:32 87e7bdb8b71b417aab2854b837e6374e
msgid "Three things in its output are worth reading slowly:"
msgstr ""
"它的输出里有三处值得慢慢读："

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:34 33c103e814e647c6a4445dca3571a7a2
msgid ""
"the recipe with a hand-over speed of zero is **refused by "
"``validate()``**, not started and abandoned;"
msgstr ""
"交接转速为零的配方会被 **``validate()`` 拒绝** ，而不是先启动再放弃；"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:36 b4d982f4aa1d42a8b45e7f8092969173
msgid ""
"during the hold the current is constant and the forced angle does not "
"move -- that is the point of the hold, and a shorter hold than the "
"rotor's settling time is the most common way to make this sequence look "
"like it does not work;"
msgstr ""
"保持期间电流恒定、强制角不动——这正是保持的意义；保持时间短于转子的稳定时"
"间，是让这条时序显得不起作用的最常见做法；"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:39 12b95f75f782435ea841eba85963f886
msgid ""
"``finished`` means the hand-over speed was reached. It does **not** mean "
"the rotor came with the vector. That judgement needs a speed measurement,"
" and it lives one window later in the motor's hand-over check."
msgstr ""
"``finished`` 意味着到达了交接转速。它 **并不** 意味着转子跟上了矢量。那"
"个判断需要转速测量，落在电机交接检查里、晚一个窗口。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:44 f5f9d5bcc6cc494caf839c9b57623469
msgid "Where the numbers come from"
msgstr ""
"数字的来源"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:46 4c8513b508344c62ad02f1dbec066659
msgid ""
"Every field of the recipe is a statement about the **load**, not about "
"the machine, and none of them is derivable from the nameplate:"
msgstr ""
"配方的每个字段都是关于 **负载** 的陈述，而不是关于电机的；其中没有一个能"
"从铭牌推出来："

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:49 f62c34d1afbb43ffa1d2acf7ba57721c
msgid ""
"the hold current has to produce enough torque to move the rotor to the "
"forced angle against friction and gravity, and no more;"
msgstr ""
"保持电流要产生足够的转矩，在摩擦和重力作用下把转子推到强制角，且不多于此"
"；"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:51 8c78368e933640088468c79b80e49d78
msgid "the hold time has to outlast the rotor's settling at that torque;"
msgstr ""
"保持时间要长于转子在该转矩下的稳定时间；"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:52 69c7c90a34064d64bd494cccd5d3bb26
msgid ""
"the pull acceleration has to stay under what the rotor can follow at that"
" current, or the vector simply slides past it -- the rotor stays where it"
" was and everything looks normal;"
msgstr ""
"拖动加速度要低于转子在该电流下跟得上的值，否则矢量会直接滑过去——转子停在"
"原处，而一切看起来正常；"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:55 d31237fb156047b7b04ce39ad4b26ef9
msgid ""
"the hand-over speed has to be above where the observer works and below "
"where the pull can actually reach."
msgstr ""
"交接转速要高于观测器能工作的转速，低于拖动实际能达到的转速。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:58 8e384117efb242ce8d3ac5cae1eed9bf
msgid ""
"The law that ties the acceleration, the current and the inertia is the "
"slip law on ``foc/core/startup.hpp``'s claim row; the numbers it produces"
" for a specific machine are in that row's evidence, not on this page."
msgstr ""
"把加速度、电流和惯量联系起来的是 ``foc/core/startup.hpp`` 主张行上的滑差"
"律；它对某台具体电机给出的数字在那行的证据里，不在本页。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:63 a5d9346fdfd143d998f4b0231e97ccba
msgid "How it goes wrong"
msgstr ""
"失效方式"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:65 de28b162ba4a4a82aaa1366c8a9b833a
msgid ""
"**The rotor never followed, and nothing says so.** The vector ramps, the "
"angle advances, ``finished`` is true, and the axis is stationary. Nothing"
" in this slice catches that; ``stall_start`` and the hand-over check "
"exist because of it. Treat ``finished`` as \"the sequence ran\", never as"
" \"the motor is turning\"."
msgstr ""
"**转子始终没跟上，而且没有任何东西说明这一点。** 矢量在爬升，角度在推进"
"， ``finished`` 为真，而轴静止不动。本切片里没有任何东西能抓到它； ``"
"stall_start`` 和交接检查正是为此而存在。把 ``finished`` 当作“时序跑完了”"
"，永远不要当作“电机在转”。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:69 b555271e2aa54601931fb8261de742ec
msgid ""
"**Hand-over before the observer converged.** The observer needs a window "
"of speed to converge, so the hand-over speed is a floor, not a target to "
"minimise. Handing over early lands the axis on a wrong angle with full "
"current, which is the most damaging failure in this list."
msgstr ""
"**观测器收敛之前就交接。** 观测器需要一段转速窗口才能收敛，因此交接转速"
"是一个下限，不是要尽量压小的目标。过早交接会让轴带着满电流落在错误的角度"
"上，这是本清单里破坏性最大的失效。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:73 88a5e39888ee45c9a141b574a6b5e0ec
msgid ""
"**Acceleration the rotor cannot follow.** Every increment of the pull "
"acceleration is a smaller margin between \"dragged\" and \"slipped\". The"
" failure is silent: slip does not throw, it just stops transferring "
"torque."
msgstr ""
"**转子跟不上的加速度。** 拖动加速度每加一档，“被拖动”与“打滑”之间的余量"
"就小一分。这种失效是无声的：打滑不会抛异常，它只是不再传递转矩。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:76 8180ef04108942d182804e3d653ca395
msgid ""
"**Handing over without seeding the observer.** The observer's own state "
"is not the angle the sequence just produced. Seed both angle and speed, "
"or the first moments after hand-over are spent as error."
msgstr ""
"**交接时没有预置观测器状态。** 观测器自己的状态并不是这条时序刚刚产生的"
"角度。角度和转速都要预置，否则交接之后的头几个瞬间全都花在误差上。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:81 273297e426bf431c87fe1c8d94d730fb
msgid "Evidence"
msgstr ""
"证据"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:83 2df78bba3e594cbcb55deb5942640829
msgid ""
"Four claim rows cover this slice -- ``foc/core/startup.hpp``, "
"``foc/core/alignment.hpp``, ``foc/core/observer/blended_observer.hpp`` "
"and ``foc/core/stall_start.hpp`` -- and the level this page may state is "
"the minimum of those four. The levels themselves are read from the claim "
"table in the project ``README.md``."
msgstr ""
"四条主张行覆盖本切片—— ``foc/core/startup.hpp`` 、 ``"
"foc/core/alignment.hpp`` 、 ``foc/core/observer/blended_observer.hpp`` "
"和 ``foc/core/stall_start.hpp`` ——本页可以陈述的等级是这四条中的最小值。"
"等级本身从项目 ``README.md`` 的主张表读取。"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:90 420123ee1dc64b50aacbefc17a22ed5c
msgid "Figure"
msgstr ""
"图"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:97 54a52ce2af094373806bdd49281c7365
msgid ""
"the forced angle (unwrapped) and the current the recipe asks for: a flat "
"hold, a dashed line where the pull starts, then the acceleration parabola"
msgstr ""
"强制角（展开后）与配方所要求的电流：一段平坦的保持，一条标示拖动起点的虚"
"线，然后是加速度抛物线"

#: ../../source/guides/slice-s1-startup.rst:100
#: cb4a261fe89c49b28dcc59635f385ce6
msgid ""
"The figure is produced by ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` from this page's"
" own example, so the snippet and the curve are one translation unit. What"
" it does **not** show is a rotor: there is no plant in this program, so "
"the angle is the one the routine commanded. Whether the rotor followed is"
" exactly the question this figure cannot answer -- see the first failure "
"mode above."
msgstr ""
"图由 ``docs/demos/make_figures.py`` 从本页自己的示例生成，因此代码片段与"
"曲线是同一个编译单元。它 **没有** 展示的是转子：本程序里没有被控对象，所"
"以角度是例程所命令的那个。转子是否跟上，恰恰是这张图回答不了的问题——见上"
"面第一条失效方式。"

